
<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<interface>
  <requires lib="gtk" version="4.0"/>

  
<!-- Text buffer that contains hard-coded text -->
  <object class="GtkTextBuffer" id="buffer">
    <property name="text">GTK4 application using the PTX205R and the RUL SDK's reference implementation for the Raspberry Pi and SPI.

Polls for RF-technologies A, B, F, V. If a card is activated, card inforamtion is displayed. If the card contains an NDEF message, it's displayed as UTF-8 encoded text, without any parsing. Only one single card in the field is supported.

